   "text": "COQUILLE APPLICATIVE & LAYOUTS\n• BlankComponent : Routes publiques (/login, /erreur/403,\n/404)\n• FullComponent : Gabarit connecté (Header, Sidebar,\nBreadcrumb)\n• Directives structurelles : *hasRole, *hasPermission\n• Services UI : ThemeService, NotificationService,\nNavService",
   "originalText": "COQUILLE APPLICATIVE & LAYOUTS\n• BlankComponent : Routes publiques (/login, /erreur/403,\n/404)\n• FullComponent : Gabarit connecté (Header, Sidebar,\nBreadcrumb)\n• Directives structurelles : *hasRole, *hasPermission\n• Services UI : ThemeService, NotificationService,\nNavService",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "a_shell",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
