   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "INFRASTRUCTURE HTTP CLIENT (@core/http & @core/auth)\n• ApiService : Client HTTP centralisé (URL dynamique\nconfig.json)\n• authInterceptor : Injection Bearer JWT + X-Correlation-Id\n(UUID)\n• errorInterceptor : Gestion globale erreurs & Refresh token\nsur 401\n• loadingInterceptor & retryInterceptor (tentatives\nautomatiques)\n• inMemoryInterceptor (Simulateur mémoire activable via\nconfig)",
   "originalText": "INFRASTRUCTURE HTTP CLIENT (@core/http & @core/auth)\n• ApiService : Client HTTP centralisé (URL dynamique\nconfig.json)\n• authInterceptor : Injection Bearer JWT + X-Correlation-Id\n(UUID)\n• errorInterceptor : Gestion globale erreurs & Refresh token\nsur 401\n• loadingInterceptor & retryInterceptor (tentatives\nautomatiques)\n• inMemoryInterceptor (Simulateur mémoire activable via\nconfig)",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "a_http",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
