   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "STACK DOCKER COMPOSE DU BACKEND (docker-compose.yml)\n• 9 Services conteneurisés d'infrastructure :\n1. postgressodepa (port 5433, volume postgres_data_sodepa)\n2. postgres (port interne, base pour keycloak)\n3. keycloak:26.0.0 (port 8070)\n4. redis:7-alpine (port 6379, volume redis_data)\n5. rabbitmq:3.13.1-management (ports 5672, 15672)\n6. clickhouse-server:26.7 (ports 8123, 9010)\n7. minio (port 7004, console 9001) + minio-init (création\nbucket)\n8. vault:1.15.2 (port 8200) · 9. mailhog (ports 1025, 8025)",
   "originalText": "STACK DOCKER COMPOSE DU BACKEND (docker-compose.yml)\n• 9 Services conteneurisés d'infrastructure :\n1. postgressodepa (port 5433, volume postgres_data_sodepa)\n2. postgres (port interne, base pour keycloak)\n3. keycloak:26.0.0 (port 8070)\n4. redis:7-alpine (port 6379, volume redis_data)\n5. rabbitmq:3.13.1-management (ports 5672, 15672)\n6. clickhouse-server:26.7 (ports 8123, 9010)\n7. minio (port 7004, console 9001) + minio-init (création\nbucket)\n8. vault:1.15.2 (port 8200) · 9. mailhog (ports 1025, 8025)",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "f_dc",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
